      "note": "Every kind and branch listed here was observed fewer than 3 times, all of them inside `atrium`, the only shipped level with a button, a door or a portal. For a kind seen once the cross-transition agreement assertion cannot fire -- there is nothing for the single observation to disagree with -- so its coefficient sum is a single measurement, not a confirmed constant. The general claim rests on the monotonicity argument, which these transitions are consistent with and do not independently establish.",
